## Reader Tips

The main elements are 2 notebooks one is for EDA, another one is for modelling

If you run the EDA notebook please make sure you have internet connections

Before running any code you should install all libraries mentioned in requirements.txt

## Tips

    ~ Use ctrl + shift + v can render markdown file

    ~ Ctrl + H for find and repalce in vscode

    ~ A standard Markdown table requires a header row, a divider row, and data rows. Always ensure there is a blank line before the table so it renders properly

    ~ We should reload own libs after modifiy the libs: import importlib importlib.reload(dpf)

## Warning
    ~ The xlrd engine is deprecated and will be removed in a future version. Use the calamine engine instead, by setting engine='calamine'.
    ~ Pandas4Warning: The inplace keyword in DataFrame.set_index is deprecated and will be removed in a future version (PDEP-8).
    ~ Since we need to dowload data from google drive so the internet is required

